    },
    {
      "key": "t624a11aa31ff4d16",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Result for buyer</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">購入者の結果</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t53e11f1e7d02300e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">More favorable</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">より有利</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t41ed93de2831d9d2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Less favorable</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">あまり好ましくない</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t081a491883b12d70",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage type</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">スリッページの種類</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t571e3ebc6c29b162",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Outcome 1: Positive Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">結果 1: プラスのスリッページ</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t16de297eee0f7944",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Instead of filling at 1.1050, the order executes at 1.1047.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">注文は1.1050ではなく1.1047で約定します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4f65195571488869",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Outcome 2: Negative Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">結果 2: マイナスのスリッページ</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8169a695652588c9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Does High Slippage Mean?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">大きなスリッページとはどういう意味ですか？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5ff1bf431f5656e1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High slippage means there is a relatively large difference between the expected price and the actual execution price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">スリッページが大きいということは、予想価格と実際の約定価格の間に比較的大きな差があることを意味します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta8cb06bbbb0219b3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">It may occur when:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">次の場合に発生する可能性があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf518f68125738021",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution is delayed</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">約定が遅延する</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3002e6903179ce62",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High slippage does not have one universal numerical threshold.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">高スリッページには、単一の普遍的な数値閾値はありません。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t83da3e863a6bd5d2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What may be considered unusually large for one instrument could be normal for another because tick size, volatility, liquidity, and trading conditions differ.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ティックサイズ、ボラティリティ、流動性、取引条件が異なるため、ある商品では異常に大きいとみなされるものでも、別の商品では正常である可能性があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5a79465170964a0f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution policy</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">約定方針</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c67339522be1fd7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Requote or rejection rules</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">リクオートまたは注文拒否のルール</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc2e0b47765618397",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order-routing structure</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">オーダールーティング構造</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t01ccc0938b7b07bf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Actual execution records</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">実際の約定記録</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t943bc3f0de6555c8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Searching for the “lowest slippage broker” without considering these factors can oversimplify execution quality.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">これらの要素を考慮せずに「スリッページが最も低いブローカー」を検索すると、執行品質が過度に単純化される可能性があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t792f4f026539ed8e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Can Traders Manage Slippage Risk?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレーダーはスリッページのリスクをどのように管理できるでしょうか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta297a3342b47edc0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage cannot be eliminated completely, but traders can make execution choices that reduce exposure to some of the conditions associated with unfavorable fills.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">スリッページを完全に排除することはできませんが、トレーダーは不利な約定に関連するいくつかの条件への曝露を軽減する執行選択を行うことができます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t30bbc8c51a544c5f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A limit order can provide more control over the price condition for entry or exit.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">指値注文を使用すると、エントリーまたはエグジットの価格条件をより詳細に制御できます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t64aaea8d9ad1f11f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">However, this creates a trade-off.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ただし、これにはトレードオフが生じます。</span>"
    }
  ]
}
